  "changelog": "- Initial release of emergency evacuation routing tool.\n- Supports multi-origin evacuation route planning with hazard avoidance and shelter capacity constraints.\n- Uses 8-connected Dijkstra shortest paths on raster cost surfaces.\n- Generates output files: distance map (GeoTIFF), evacuation routes (GeoJSON), routing statistics (JSON), and run manifest.\n- Works offline with both synthetic and real geospatial data inputs.\n- All processing is local; user data privacy is preserved (no uploads).",
